                                         * in the ligature table in place of the marked
                                         * (i.e. currently-popped) glyph. */
      LigActionOffset   = 0x3FFFFFFF,   /* A 30-bit value which is sign-extended to 32-bits
                                         * and added to the glyph ID, resulting in an index
